      row
        link "View on GitHub" https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v5.3.8/site/src/content/docs/getting-started/vite.mdx
        h1 Bootstrap and Vite
      text The official guide for how to include and bundle Bootstrap’s CSS and JavaScript in your project using Vite.
    col
      text On this page
      link "What is Vite?" #what-is-vite
      link Setup #setup
      link "Project structure" #project-structure
      link "Configure Vite" #configure-vite
      link "Import Bootstrap" #import-bootstrap
      card
        link "https://srv.carbonads.net/ads/click/x/GTND4277CVBDV2JJCYS4YKQUF67ITKQYCWSDTZ3JCAAI627ICEBDV2JKC6BD6K7LC6YIL2QJFT7IE23LCV7IK5QUHEYI55QLCESI623ECTNCYBZ52K" https://srv.carbonads.net/ads/click/x/GTND4277CVBDV2JJCYS4YKQUF67ITKQYCWSDTZ3JCAAI627ICEBDV2JKC6BD6K7LC6YIL2QJFT7IE23LCV7IK5QUHEYI55QLCESI623ECTNCYBZ52K
